WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.038
Here's the route.

2
00:00:01.038 --> 00:00:03.976
Scene one reads the
landing-zone baseline back.

3
00:00:03.976 --> 00:00:08.063
Scene two lists every public face
of the portal, with its owner.

4
00:00:08.063 --> 00:00:13.224
Scene three asks which of its public IP
addresses are really under DDoS protection.

5
00:00:13.224 --> 00:00:17.688
Scene four finds a web application
firewall that logs but doesn't block.

6
00:00:17.688 --> 00:00:22.038
Scene five checks whether the portal's
origins can be reached around the edge.

7
00:00:22.038 --> 00:00:24.076
Scene six follows its egress.

8
00:00:24.076 --> 00:00:26.263
Scene seven reads its key vault.

9
00:00:26.263 --> 00:00:31.450
Scene eight holds it all with policy,
compares two weeks, and records the evidence.

10
00:00:31.450 --> 00:00:34.562
And scene nine takes the
kit live, test first.

11
00:00:34.562 --> 00:00:36.414
Each scene has a story slide,

12
00:00:36.414 --> 00:00:40.100
a try-it slide with real output,
and a one-question check.
